<h2>Is there a best supplement to lower cortisol?</h2>
<p>There is no universal product choice that follows from feeling stressed or seeing a high app score. Different supplements, formulations and studies address different questions. A laboratory change in a selected study group does not establish a treatment for everyone.</p>
<h2>Read the outcome, not just the product name</h2>
<p>Check whether research measured perceived stress, sleep, fatigue or cortisol, and whether it studied the exact product being sold. A benefit on one outcome does not prove all the others. A result for a single extract is not automatically evidence for a multi-ingredient blend.</p>
